WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.440
The shining time...

00:08.610 --> 00:16.160
...I have always imagined.

00:25.120 --> 00:30.250
Something will change tomorrow.

00:32.340 --> 00:38.640
I can sense it.

00:39.810 --> 00:46.900
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

00:47.190 --> 00:54.860
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

00:55.780 --> 01:01.870
You've run so far.

01:02.950 --> 01:10.130
So I felt the air of your love.

01:10.340 --> 01:16.340
Soon after I see you,

01:17.680 --> 01:23.640
my stolen heart beats.

01:55.630 --> 01:57.220
CHIAKI!!!

02:01.760 --> 02:03.260
Sinbad!

02:10.060 --> 02:11.520
Chiaki!!!

02:11.900 --> 02:18.570
<i>Checkmate!</i> The Demon Butterfly, Blue Morpho!

02:18.570 --> 02:21.280
What?! Chiaki got shot?!

02:22.370 --> 02:24.790
Maron, what happened?!

02:24.790 --> 02:25.950
I don't know...

02:25.950 --> 02:29.210
I followed Chiaki to Momokuri Park...

02:29.210 --> 02:33.920
...and suddenly he was shot... And then taken away in a car.

02:33.920 --> 02:34.920
What kind of car?

02:34.920 --> 02:35.920
Navy blue station wagon.

02:35.920 --> 02:36.880
License number?

02:38.510 --> 02:39.880
I don't know...

02:41.340 --> 02:43.850
No doubt it's the kidnapper.

02:43.850 --> 02:46.600
Chiaki-kun was probably told to go there.

02:46.600 --> 02:51.020
The phone call must have come while we were setting up the trace.

02:51.020 --> 02:52.060
Damn!

02:52.060 --> 02:54.940
I told him not to do anything on his own!

02:54.940 --> 02:57.240
Same for you, Maron!

02:57.240 --> 03:00.320
Why didn't you report this to us?!

03:01.660 --> 03:04.410
Miyako, don't be so hard on her.

03:04.410 --> 03:06.830
Set up a road block to inspect every passing car.

03:06.830 --> 03:07.540
Yes, sir!

03:07.540 --> 03:08.830
Navy blue station wagon.

03:08.830 --> 03:11.540
The suspect is believed to have a rifle...

03:11.540 --> 03:15.000
...and the victim is a young male, who is seriously injured.

03:15.000 --> 03:17.090
That's all we know right now.

03:17.090 --> 03:19.050
Execute an immediate search.

03:19.050 --> 03:20.260
Yes, sir!

03:20.260 --> 03:21.430
Chiaki...

03:22.640 --> 03:23.430
Maron!

03:26.430 --> 03:28.930
Hey...Maron?

03:35.940 --> 03:37.440
<i>You're pretty, too.</i>

03:39.320 --> 03:41.950
<i>It's okay now, Maron.</i>

03:43.280 --> 03:44.530
<i>What color are they today?</i>

03:46.030 --> 03:48.950
<i>What's wrong? Did you hurt your leg?</i>

03:51.080 --> 03:54.330
<i>Please Chiaki, be okay...</i>

03:55.920 --> 03:58.960
Maron, keep your spirits up.

04:00.130 --> 04:02.050
I'm fine.

04:05.260 --> 04:09.270
I'm fine! Strong and serious... Energetic and...

04:10.850 --> 04:11.930
Maron!

04:11.930 --> 04:16.360
You're right. I have no choice but to believe that he's okay.

04:16.360 --> 04:19.230
Fin...search for Chiaki!

04:19.230 --> 04:24.660
What?! I can search for Demons, but Chiaki is a normal human!

04:24.660 --> 04:27.580
I don't know how I would go about searching for him...

04:29.660 --> 04:33.410
These have Chiaki's scent on them. Use that to look for him, please!

04:33.410 --> 04:35.960
Okay, I'll see what I can do...

04:43.130 --> 04:44.430
This way?

04:46.970 --> 04:48.600
Fin, please!

04:49.350 --> 04:54.230
She must be out of her mind! I'm not a police dog!

04:56.850 --> 04:58.150
It's coming from over there!

05:01.360 --> 05:03.650
Any reports so far?

05:03.650 --> 05:07.030
The suspect's car has not been found yet.

05:07.030 --> 05:10.700
It appears that the car already got past the road block.

05:21.710 --> 05:23.260
Yes? Hello?

05:25.090 --> 05:27.550
What did you say?! Chiaki's father did what?!

05:28.260 --> 05:29.550
I understand.

05:30.850 --> 05:31.640
Yes.

05:33.060 --> 05:36.310
Chiaki's father came back to the hospital!

05:36.310 --> 05:37.140
What?!

05:45.440 --> 05:48.240
Did the kidnapper have any special characteristics?

05:48.240 --> 05:52.990
I don't know. The last thing I remember was walking down the hallway...

05:52.990 --> 05:55.830
He must have been tranquilized.

05:55.830 --> 05:58.670
Where were you held until now?

05:58.670 --> 06:04.010
I was unconscious the whole time and when I came to, I was lying in Momokuri Park.

06:04.760 --> 06:06.800
Momokuri Park...

06:07.550 --> 06:10.050
Then you had no contact with the suspect?

06:10.050 --> 06:12.260
No, none at all.

06:12.260 --> 06:16.560
Well, we have received a ransom note.

06:16.560 --> 06:19.020
There was no reason to release you without the demands being fulfilled.

06:19.020 --> 06:24.480
Also, your son was shot and taken away by an unknown assailant.

06:24.480 --> 06:26.780
What?! Chiaki-sama was...?!

06:28.910 --> 06:30.450
I don't remember anything.

06:30.450 --> 06:31.740
Sir!

06:31.740 --> 06:34.540
Detective, the president is exhausted now.

06:34.540 --> 06:37.250
Could you put off questioning him until later?

06:37.250 --> 06:38.210
Excuse me...

06:56.310 --> 06:57.730
What's wrong?

06:58.730 --> 07:00.770
Maron, where are you going?!

07:09.740 --> 07:11.530
Hello, Maron!

07:11.530 --> 07:14.410
Fin, what are you doing here?

07:14.410 --> 07:20.410
Why?! I followed the scent on this and ended up here.

07:20.410 --> 07:23.460
What? Then, Chiaki is in this hospital?

07:23.460 --> 07:25.960
The scent is much stronger here.

07:25.960 --> 07:28.760
And I feel the presence of a Demon here...

07:30.840 --> 07:32.340
So it is here!!!

07:37.100 --> 07:40.430
It could be that the disappearance of the doctors and nurses...

07:40.430 --> 07:44.560
...and Chiaki's shooting are connected to the Demon!

07:44.560 --> 07:46.520
No doubt about it!

07:48.440 --> 07:52.280
I have to find the Demon as soon as possible. or Chiaki will...!

08:04.250 --> 08:05.540
What floor is it?

08:05.540 --> 08:06.750
Leave it to me!

08:15.340 --> 08:18.310
The legendary butterfly...

08:18.310 --> 08:19.770
Blue Morpho...

08:35.490 --> 08:36.370
Access!

08:37.740 --> 08:39.540
I knew you were behind this!

08:40.580 --> 08:43.540
I won't let you get away with it this time!

08:43.540 --> 08:45.040
Let me go!

08:45.040 --> 08:46.330
Stop!

08:50.460 --> 08:54.260
Access! I won't let you <i>Checkmate</i> this time!

08:54.260 --> 08:57.680
Sinbad isn't here! I couldn't even if I wanted to...

09:08.190 --> 09:10.570
What? A notice from Jeanne?!

09:11.150 --> 09:12.530
Yes, sir.

09:12.530 --> 09:19.450
<i>"Nagoya Kaiki-sama, I will have the beauty of the Blue Morpho in your collection." - Kaitou Jeanne</i>

09:21.620 --> 09:23.290
What the hell is going on?

09:34.880 --> 09:38.550
Maron, be careful. The Demon seems to be tougher this time.

09:39.800 --> 09:40.550
Here goes.

09:51.360 --> 09:52.860
<i>I want to save Chiaki!</i>

09:52.860 --> 09:54.780
<i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power.</i>

10:05.160 --> 10:06.830
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

10:06.830 --> 10:08.750
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

10:08.750 --> 10:10.420
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

10:21.890 --> 10:22.850
Where is it?

10:24.140 --> 10:25.850
Which one...

10:25.850 --> 10:28.810
...is the legendary butterfly, Blue Morpho?

10:33.440 --> 10:34.860
What's this?

10:36.530 --> 10:37.860
A mannequin?

10:43.740 --> 10:46.410
A real...human?!

10:46.410 --> 10:48.660
Yes. Isn't it beautiful?

10:53.130 --> 10:55.750
The Demon has possessed his soul!

10:55.750 --> 10:56.880
It's that butterfly!

10:58.260 --> 11:03.050
Everyone here is on the brink of death, thanks to the butterfly's powder.

11:03.050 --> 11:04.470
How evil.

11:04.470 --> 11:07.350
The butterfly displays were just distractions.

11:07.350 --> 11:11.730
These people are still breathing, although just barely.

11:11.730 --> 11:14.440
It's the ultimate work of art.

11:16.150 --> 11:18.860
Wake up! Open your eyes!

11:18.860 --> 11:19.950
It's no use.

11:21.360 --> 11:26.870
They will not wake up unless the effects of the butterfly's powder wear off.

11:29.660 --> 11:32.790
All it needs is two more to be complete.

11:32.790 --> 11:35.840
My beautiful son...

11:35.840 --> 11:38.960
...and the mesmerizing Kaitou Jeanne.

11:38.960 --> 11:40.760
Chiaki and me?

11:40.760 --> 11:42.840
Then, Chiaki is still alive?

11:42.840 --> 11:49.180
I'll display you in this case alongside this blue rose with the butterfly's powder.

11:49.180 --> 11:53.350
Too bad! There's no way I'm surrendering to your rose!

11:54.610 --> 11:58.730
I'm offering eternal beauty with my love!

12:03.820 --> 12:07.200
Don't kid yourself! It won't end up the way you want!

12:11.160 --> 12:12.540
In the name of God...

12:12.540 --> 12:14.670
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

12:14.670 --> 12:16.340
I seal you here!

12:17.250 --> 12:19.550
One-way love is unacceptable!

12:19.550 --> 12:22.050
This kind of twisted love will only hurt others!

12:25.470 --> 12:28.310
The love of every individual is irreplaceable!

12:28.310 --> 12:32.850
All humans are driven by their own greed!

12:32.850 --> 12:34.560
Greed is paramount!

12:34.560 --> 12:36.730
Love is unnecessary!

12:38.360 --> 12:42.650
You're wrong! Love is essential to life!

12:42.650 --> 12:43.570
<i>Checkma--</i>

12:43.570 --> 12:44.360
SHUT UP!

12:46.530 --> 12:48.240
I <i>will</i> believe!

12:48.240 --> 12:54.160
No matter what, people must have love for their families and others...

12:56.540 --> 12:59.840
Well Jeanne, you were worth the chase.

13:07.390 --> 13:09.970
Notice

13:07.390 --> 13:09.970
Don't go away!

13:07.390 --> 13:09.970
I'll return right after these messages!

13:07.390 --> 13:09.970
Kaitou Jeanne

13:10.850 --> 13:13.480
Notice

13:10.850 --> 13:13.480
I'm back to continue my adventures

13:10.850 --> 13:13.480
Kaitou Jeanne

13:25.950 --> 13:27.360
Where...?

13:34.000 --> 13:35.120
Chiaki!!!

13:49.180 --> 13:51.810
<i>Why isn't Dad coming?</i>

13:51.810 --> 13:54.600
<i>It's okay if he's not here.</i>

13:54.600 --> 13:59.730
<i>Our hearts are connected, so I know how he feels right now.</i>

14:00.480 --> 14:04.490
<i>Chiaki, take good care of your father...</i>

14:06.700 --> 14:08.160
<i>Mom!</i>

14:26.470 --> 14:28.510
<i>Look at your dad...</i>

14:31.680 --> 14:34.350
Chiaki... Chiaki!!!

14:37.270 --> 14:38.690
Was I sleeping?

14:39.770 --> 14:41.860
Jeanne?! Why are you here?

14:41.860 --> 14:45.650
We have to escape. We have to save your father!

14:45.650 --> 14:46.780
That's...

14:47.780 --> 14:49.070
...not my father!

14:49.070 --> 14:51.280
He isn't himself right now!

14:51.280 --> 14:55.580
You probably won't believe me, but he's possessed by a Demon!

14:55.580 --> 14:57.660
That has nothing to do with it.

14:57.660 --> 15:00.170
He was like a Demon in the first place!

15:00.170 --> 15:03.880
That's not true! He truly loves you!

15:03.880 --> 15:04.880
Love?

15:05.880 --> 15:11.760
There's not a speck of love in the man who wasn't there when my mother died!

15:13.180 --> 15:16.350
You're wrong. You don't have to be nearby to love another.

15:16.350 --> 15:17.850
Even from far away...

15:18.980 --> 15:25.860
I've discovered that love intensifies the further away someone is...

15:25.860 --> 15:30.150
Even if they're not together, if they believe in each other, and their hearts are connected...

15:30.150 --> 15:31.700
...Love endures!

15:33.660 --> 15:41.580
<i>Our hearts are connected so I know how he feels right now.</i>

15:47.550 --> 15:51.680
<i>Even if they're not together, if they believe in each other and their hearts are connected...</i>

15:52.720 --> 15:56.050
It's not just you. Everyone has sad times.

15:56.050 --> 16:01.480
Your father was possessed because of his pure heart.

16:04.480 --> 16:05.480
Believe me.

16:10.570 --> 16:13.280
Hello! Jeanne...

16:13.280 --> 16:14.160
Fin!

16:22.460 --> 16:26.000
Wait here. I'll get him to return to his normal self.

16:28.590 --> 16:29.710
Maron...

16:35.260 --> 16:37.260
Jeanne is here!

16:37.260 --> 16:40.270
The Demon's butterfly has been moved to the Nagoya residence.

16:40.270 --> 16:40.930
Got it!

16:50.820 --> 16:54.860
You've finally come, Jeanne. I'm happy I get to meet you again.

16:54.860 --> 16:56.660
I'm a guardian of the law.

16:56.660 --> 16:59.370
A female detective who will someday enforce the law.

16:59.370 --> 17:00.490
I am Toudaiji Miyako!

17:03.290 --> 17:07.460
I won't let you go this time. Miyako Special, Part Ten!

17:15.470 --> 17:16.800
Not bad, Jeanne!

17:33.940 --> 17:36.950
Bingo! Miyako Special, Part Eleven!

17:38.280 --> 17:39.410
Sleeping gas!

17:39.410 --> 17:41.580
Now! Get her!

17:41.580 --> 17:42.370
Jeanne!

17:46.580 --> 17:49.590
I can't let my guard down against Miyako!

17:49.590 --> 17:53.260
Open up! Miyako-san!

17:59.760 --> 18:00.680
This way...

18:01.560 --> 18:04.770
I won't let you go, my beautiful prey.

18:08.850 --> 18:14.070
A person who neither speaks nor feels is nothing but an imitation!

18:14.070 --> 18:18.410
People are beautiful because they can feel sadness, concern and joy!

18:26.620 --> 18:27.870
I'll take you on!

18:46.270 --> 18:48.060
In the name of God...

18:48.060 --> 18:49.980
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

18:51.190 --> 18:52.360
I seal you here!

18:54.980 --> 18:57.070
<i>Checkmate!</i>

19:05.660 --> 19:06.700
I got it!

19:30.060 --> 19:31.770
Huh? Where is this place?

19:35.860 --> 19:38.280
That day, there was a phone call from your mother.

19:38.280 --> 19:40.280
She told me not to come.

19:40.280 --> 19:41.570
What?!

19:41.570 --> 19:46.280
There is no husband who wouldn't be by the side of his dying wife.

19:46.280 --> 19:49.450
I tried to convince her, but she refused.

19:49.450 --> 19:50.460
Why?!

19:50.460 --> 19:54.170
She said she didn't want me to see her looking so pitifully frail.

19:54.170 --> 19:55.380
I couldn't help it.

19:59.090 --> 20:08.060
And I made a promise to myself: To keep her beauty in my heart.

20:08.060 --> 20:11.980
You probably don't believe in this kind of love.

20:11.980 --> 20:16.770
Then, why weren't you more respectful of her feelings?

20:16.770 --> 20:18.860
Why did you re-marry so many times?!

20:20.570 --> 20:22.200
Why...?

20:24.160 --> 20:27.370
I thought it would be better for you.

20:28.370 --> 20:31.910
I felt that you were too young to grow up without a mother.

20:32.330 --> 20:37.880
<i>It's not just you. Everyone has sad times, including your father.</i>

20:38.380 --> 20:43.340
However, I think my kind of loving was wrong.

20:45.680 --> 20:47.390
No, it wasn't.

20:57.860 --> 21:00.150
Jeanne got away again!

21:00.150 --> 21:07.370
But isn't it a good thing that Chiaki-kun and the hospital staff came back?

21:07.370 --> 21:09.580
That's true, but...

21:09.580 --> 21:12.870
But nobody remembers a thing.

21:12.870 --> 21:15.370
What was all that fuss about, anyway?

21:15.370 --> 21:17.710
I don't know! Geez!!!

21:21.090 --> 21:24.630
Chiaki, aren't you going back to your house?

21:24.630 --> 21:30.100
No. I want to live alone a little longer. And...

21:31.060 --> 21:32.100
And...?

21:39.480 --> 21:42.480
Oh, that's what it was!

21:42.480 --> 21:44.490
What? What is it?

21:45.490 --> 21:48.160
<i>The mystery of the dream is solved.</i>

21:48.160 --> 21:51.160
<i>I finally realized who the woman from my dream is.</i>

21:51.160 --> 21:55.330
Sweeter than an angel, more admired than a goddess...

21:57.080 --> 22:00.670
<i>She is the most important girl to me.</i>

22:05.470 --> 22:11.300
For billions of years,

22:11.390 --> 22:20.860
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:23.020 --> 22:29.490
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.740 --> 22:35.790
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.410 --> 22:39.210
The huge mountains...

22:41.920 --> 22:48.840
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.340 --> 22:53.890
It took everything.

22:56.140 --> 23:02.110
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.190 --> 23:09.110
we watched the world ending...

23:09.320 --> 23:15.160
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.290 --> 23:24.960
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:32.140 --> 23:39.980
On this luxury cruise, there's absolutely no escape. Hehehe... Now Jeanne's trapped like a rat!

23:39.980 --> 23:41.940
We'll see... Where am I?

23:41.940 --> 23:47.070
Ehhh?! Wherever I look: Jeanne! Jeanne! Jeanne as far as the eye can see!

23:47.070 --> 23:50.780
Not Sinbad, too... What's going on here...

23:50.780 --> 23:54.700
Kaimake Kaitou Jeanne: Luxury Cruise, Monkey Panic

23:54.700 --> 23:59.330
The target is amidst the costume party. Where could they be hiding?
